# Read by ripgrep, fd and the editor/agent search tools built on them (git ignores this file's
# rules). These are history, not current design: a default search should land on the docs
# that describe the tree as it is. Search them on purpose with `rg --no-ignore-dot` or by
# naming the path (`rg PATTERN docs/devlog`).
docs/archive/
docs/devlog/
docs/devlog.md
